NormalCity_House1_Text_HelpMonEvolve::
	.string "I can help your POKéMON evolve the\n"
	.string "moment it's ready to change.\p"
	.string "I'll charge you ¥5000 for the service.\n"
	.string "Shall I help you?$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_WhichMon::
	.string "Which POKéMON shall I help evolve?$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_EvolveFor5000::
	.string "I can evolve your {STR_VAR_1}\n"
	.string "for ¥5000.\p"
	.string "Shall I proceed?$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_NotReadyToEvolve::
	.string "Hmm, that one doesn't seem ready\n"
	.string "to evolve just yet.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_NotEnoughMoney::
	.string "You don't have enough money with you.\n"
	.string "Come back when you've got ¥5000.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_Success::
	.string "There! See how your POKéMON changed?\n"
	.string "It was happy to evolve.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_BerryRipe::
	.string "Ah, a guest! This old house hides a\n"
	.string "secret: the last berry orchard of\l"
	.string "Ivoryen City.\p"
	.string "I've tended these trees since I was a\n"
	.string "lad. Each sapling was planted by my\l"
	.string "grandfather.\p"
	.string "Well! Fortune smiles on you today.\n"
	.string "Here, a ripe berry from our trees.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_NoBerryReady::
	.string "The trees are resting today.\p"
	.string "They gave up their fruit only\n"
	.string "yesterday, and berry trees are\l"
	.string "patient creatures.\p"
	.string "These roots are older than Ivoryen\n"
	.string "City itself, so we should not rush\l"
	.string "them. Come back after a while.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_BerryPouchFull::
	.string "Ah, your BERRY POUCH is full!\p"
	.string "You cannot carry more of nature's\n"
	.string "bounty. Make room, and I shall have\n"
	.string "another ripe one waiting for you.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizIntro::
	.string "I study how well trainers know\n"
	.string "their POKéMON.\p"
	.string "I'll read you a POKéMON's\n"
	.string "description, then claim it is\l"
	.string "a certain species.\p"
	.string "Answer three questions. Get\n"
	.string "two right, and you win a prize!$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizQuestion::
	.string "Is this POKéMON {STR_VAR_1}?$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizCorrect::
	.string "Correct! You know your POKéMON\n"
	.string "well.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizWrong::
	.string "Wrong! You must study your\n"
	.string "POKéDEX more carefully.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizWin::
	.string "Impressive! You got at least two\n"
	.string "right.\p"
	.string "Here, take these RARE CANDIES\n"
	.string "as a token of my respect.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_QuizLose::
	.string "You didn't answer two correctly.\p"
	.string "Come back when you know your\n"
	.string "POKéMON a little better!$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_Proj_Green::
	.string "PROJECT GREEN\p"
	.string "The specimen does not travel\nthrough time.\p"
	.string "It moves between moments.\p"
	.string "...confirmed...\nevents observed before !?!??!\p"
	.string "not always the same afterward.\p"
	.string "Further experiments require\nauthorization.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_Incident::
	.string "INCIDENT REPORT 7\p"
	.string "The records disagree.\p"
	.string "In one report, the target survived.\n"
	.string "In another, the target was\lnever born.\p"
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Someone is remembering\lthe wrong world.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_SubjectX::
	.string "SUBJECT X\p"
	.string "Age: 10\p"
	.string "...No physical aging observed.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_AbilitySwapperIntro::
	.string "I study how a POKéMON's latent\n"
	.string "abilities awaken.\p"
	.string "Every creature holds two talents\n"
	.string "inside. Let me switch which one is\l"
	.string "active for a POKéMON of yours.\p"
	.string "It is all for research. Shall I\n"
	.string "change one now?$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_AbilitySwapperChooseMon::
	.string "Choose the POKéMON whose ability\n"
	.string "you would like to change.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_AbilitySwapperDone::
	.string "There! That POKéMON's ability has\n"
	.string "been switched.\p"
	.string "Fascinating. The change is recorded\n"
	.string "in my study.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_AbilitySwapperOneAbility::
	.string "Hmm, this POKéMON seems to hold only\n"
	.string "a single ability.\p"
	.string "There is nothing to switch. Pick\n"
	.string "another one next time.$"

NormalCity_House1_Text_AbilitySwapperEgg::
	.string "An EGG has no ability to study yet.\p"
	.string "Choose a POKéMON that has hatched.$"